
<!DOCTYPE HTML>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, minimum-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=2.0" />
<meta content="app-id=425349261" name="apple-itunes-app">
<meta content="yes" name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable">
<title>手机河南一百度</title>
<style>
body { line-height: 1; font: normal normal 0.875em/180% "Microsoft Yahei",Arial,sans-serif; color:#222;min-width:320px;margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; outline: 0; font-size: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;}
.bg{text-align:center;}
.bg div{margin-top:60px;}
.line p{margin:0 10px;}
.line{text-align:center;}
section{width:100%;}
.nav1 div{margin-top:15px;margin-left:10px;}
.nav1 img{width:50%; height:auto; max-width:261px;}
.line a{text-decoration:none;color:#163963;}
</style>

</head>

<body>
	<section class="nav1">
		<div><img src="https://www.henan100.com/static/image/mobile/logo-site.png" alt="河南一百度手机版"  /></div>
	</section>
	
	<section class="bg">
		<div><img src="https://www.henan100.com/static/image/mobile/404.png" alt="404" /></div>
 	</section>
	
	<section class="line">
		<img src="https://www.henan100.com/static/image/mobile/line_404.png" />
	</section>
	
	<section class="line">
	<p>对不起，您所访问的页面不存在！</p>
	<p>10秒后将跳转到<a href="http://www.henan100.com/">河南一百度网站首页</a>...</p>
	
	</section>
	<script>
		function go(){
			window.location.href = 'http://www.henan100.com/';
		}
		window.onload=function(){
			var bar = window.setTimeout("go()", 100000);
			
		}
	</script>
     
</body>
</html>